I now have a complete picture of the codebase. Here is the full implementation plan.

---

# NUDIMMUD Notebook Module — Implementation Plan

## Architecture Overview

The integration is strictly additive. The NotebookLM clone lives as a new `notebook` tab inside `OraclePage.tsx` (one line added to the `TABS` array and one branch in the content renderer). Everything else — backend services, DB schema, routes, React components — is net-new. No existing file is destructively modified.

---

## 1. Complete File Tree of New Files

```
backend/src/
  services/
    notebookService.ts          ← core CRUD, orchestrates all notebook ops
    notebookIngestService.ts    ← PDF/DOCX/URL/audio ingestion pipeline
    notebookTranscribeService.ts ← Whisper-local→OpenAI fallback
    notebookRagService.ts       ← chunking, embedding, RAG retrieval
    notebookDocGenService.ts    ← summary/FAQ/study guide/timeline generation
    notebookPdfExportService.ts ← Puppeteer HTML→PDF export
    notebookObsidianSyncService.ts ← push generated docs → NISABA/
    notebookVizService.ts       ← entity/temporal/topic/sentiment data extraction
  routes/
    notebookRoutes.ts           ← all /api/notebook/* routes (registered in api.ts)
  models/
    notebookSchema.ts           ← DDL + migration helpers for notebook tables

src/components/Oracle/
  NotebookTab/
    NotebookTab.tsx             ← two-pane root, exported as <NotebookTab />
    SourcesPanel.tsx            ← left pane: source list + upload controls
    SourceCard.tsx              ← single source row with status badge
    SourceUploadZone.tsx        ← drag-drop + URL/vault note picker
    ChatPane.tsx                ← right pane: notebook-scoped Q&A with SSE
    GeneratedDocsSection.tsx    ← expandable cards for summaries/FAQs/etc.
    DocCard.tsx                 ← single generated doc with PDF export button
    VizPanel.tsx                ← visualizations: charts + network + sentiment
    BarChart.tsx                ← Canvas-based bar chart (entity freq)
    LineChart.tsx               ← Canvas-based temporal line chart
    NetworkGraph.tsx            ← Three.js force-directed topic graph
    SentimentGauge.tsx          ← SVG arc gauge

src/lib/
    notebookBridge.ts           ← frontend API client (mirrors oracleCommandBridge pattern)
```

---

## 2. Changes to Existing Files (Minimal, Additive Only)

### `src/components/Oracle/OraclePage.tsx`

**Two changes only:**

Line 36 — extend the `TabId` union type:
```typescript
// BEFORE
type TabId = 'context' | 'research' | 'code' | 'visual' | 'ops';

// AFTER
type TabId = 'context' | 'research' | 'code' | 'visual' | 'ops' | 'notebook';
```

Line 38-44 — append one entry to `TABS`:
```typescript
{ id: 'notebook', label: 'Notebook', icon: '◧' }
```

Line 271-277 — add one new `else if` branch to the content area renderer, inserted before the catch-all `<OracleToolOrbs>`:
```typescript
// AFTER the VisualSynthesisLane branch:
} else if (activeTab === 'notebook') {
    // NotebookTab is imported at top of file
    <NotebookTab />
```

Add one import at the top:
```typescript
