```

No existing tables or queries are touched.

---

## 3. DB Schema (DDL)

All tables use the same pragmas (WAL, foreign_keys) as `nudimmud.db`. These live in `notebookSchema.ts` and run via `runNotebookMigrations` using the same `CREATE TABLE IF NOT EXISTS` + `addColumnIfMissing` pattern already established.

```sql
-- notebook_notebooks: top-level notebook entities
CREATE TABLE IF NOT EXISTS notebook_notebooks (
    id           INTEGER PRIMARY KEY AUTOINCREMENT,
    title        TEXT    NOT NULL DEFAULT 'Untitled Notebook',
    description  TEXT,
    model_id     TEXT    NOT NULL DEFAULT 'qwen-liberated:latest',
    created_at   TEXT    DEFAULT (datetime('now')),
    updated_at   TEXT    DEFAULT (datetime('now'))
);

-- notebook_sources: every ingested source attached to a notebook
CREATE TABLE IF NOT EXISTS notebook_sources (
    id              INTEGER PRIMARY KEY AUTOINCREMENT,
    notebook_id     INTEGER NOT NULL REFERENCES notebook_notebooks(id) ON DELETE CASCADE,
    title           TEXT    NOT NULL,
    source_type     TEXT    NOT NULL CHECK (source_type IN ('pdf','docx','audio','video','url','obsidian')),
    origin_path     TEXT,                     -- filesystem path or URL
    obsidian_path   TEXT,                     -- vault-relative path (for obsidian type)
    file_size_bytes INTEGER DEFAULT 0,
    mime_type       TEXT,
    status          TEXT    NOT NULL DEFAULT 'pending'
                    CHECK (status IN ('pending','processing','ready','error')),
    error_msg       TEXT,
    word_count      INTEGER DEFAULT 0,
    metadata        TEXT,                     -- JSON blob: duration, page_count, etc.
    created_at      TEXT    DEFAULT (datetime('now')),
    updated_at      TEXT    DEFAULT (datetime('now'))
);

-- notebook_chunks: text chunks from sources, each with an embedding
CREATE TABLE IF NOT EXISTS notebook_chunks (
    id          INTEGER PRIMARY KEY AUTOINCREMENT,
    source_id   INTEGER NOT NULL REFERENCES notebook_sources(id) ON DELETE CASCADE,
    chunk_index INTEGER NOT NULL,
    content     TEXT    NOT NULL,
    token_count INTEGER DEFAULT 0,
    embedding   TEXT,                         -- JSON float array, nullable until embedded
    metadata    TEXT,                         -- JSON: page_num, timestamp_start, etc.
    created_at  TEXT    DEFAULT (datetime('now'))
);

-- notebook_docs: auto-generated documents (summaries, FAQs, etc.)
CREATE TABLE IF NOT EXISTS notebook_docs (
    id            INTEGER PRIMARY KEY AUTOINCREMENT,
    notebook_id   INTEGER NOT NULL REFERENCES notebook_notebooks(id) ON DELETE CASCADE,
    doc_type      TEXT    NOT NULL
                  CHECK (doc_type IN ('summary','study_guide','faq','timeline','briefing')),
    title         TEXT    NOT NULL,
    content       TEXT    NOT NULL,           -- markdown body
    pdf_path      TEXT,                       -- relative path to exported PDF
    obsidian_path TEXT,                       -- path pushed to NISABA/ folder
    model_id      TEXT,
    created_at    TEXT    DEFAULT (datetime('now')),
    updated_at    TEXT    DEFAULT (datetime('now'))
);

-- notebook_messages: per-notebook chat history
CREATE TABLE IF NOT EXISTS notebook_messages (
    id          INTEGER PRIMARY KEY AUTOINCREMENT,
    notebook_id INTEGER NOT NULL REFERENCES notebook_notebooks(id) ON DELETE CASCADE,
    role        TEXT    NOT NULL CHECK (role IN ('user','assistant')),
    content     TEXT    NOT NULL,
    sources_used TEXT,                        -- JSON array of chunk IDs used in RAG
    created_at  TEXT    DEFAULT (datetime('now'))
);

-- Indexes
CREATE INDEX IF NOT EXISTS idx_nb_sources_notebook_id     ON notebook_sources(notebook_id);
CREATE INDEX IF NOT EXISTS idx_nb_sources_status          ON notebook_sources(status);
CREATE INDEX IF NOT EXISTS idx_nb_chunks_source_id        ON notebook_chunks(source_id);
CREATE INDEX IF NOT EXISTS idx_nb_chunks_embedding_notnull ON notebook_chunks(id) WHERE embedding IS NOT NULL;
CREATE INDEX IF NOT EXISTS idx_nb_docs_notebook_id        ON notebook_docs(notebook_id);
CREATE INDEX IF NOT EXISTS idx_nb_docs_doc_type           ON notebook_docs(doc_type);
CREATE INDEX IF NOT EXISTS idx_nb_messages_notebook_id    ON notebook_messages(notebook_id);
```

---

## 4. API Route Surface

All routes are registered under `/api/notebook/` by `notebookRoutes.ts`. The `initNotebookRoutes(router, db)` function appends them to the already-constructed Express router — no new router is created.

```
Notebooks (CRUD)
  POST   /api/notebook/notebooks              → create notebook             → { id, title }
  GET    /api/notebook/notebooks              → list all                    → Notebook[]
  GET    /api/notebook/notebooks/:id          → get single + sources + docs → NotebookDetail
  PATCH  /api/notebook/notebooks/:id          → update title/description    → { ok }
  DELETE /api/notebook/notebooks/:id          → cascade delete              → { ok }

Sources
  POST   /api/notebook/notebooks/:id/sources/upload
         multipart/form-data file[]           → { source_id, status }[]
  POST   /api/notebook/notebooks/:id/sources/url
         body { url: string }                 → { source_id }
  POST   /api/notebook/notebooks/:id/sources/obsidian
         body { vault_path: string }          → { source_id }
  GET    /api/notebook/sources/:sourceId      → SourceDetail
  DELETE /api/notebook/sources/:sourceId      → { ok }
  GET    /api/notebook/sources/:sourceId/status → { status, progress?, error? }

RAG Chat (SSE — mirrors oracle/stream pattern exactly)
  GET    /api/notebook/notebooks/:id/stream
         query: command=<string>&model=<string>
         SSE events: start | token | citation | done | error
         'citation' event carries { chunk_id, source_title, excerpt }

Generated Documents
  POST   /api/notebook/notebooks/:id/generate
         body { doc_type: DocType, model_id?: string }
         SSE stream → generates then saves; final event carries { doc_id }
  GET    /api/notebook/docs/:docId            → DocDetail (markdown content)
  GET    /api/notebook/docs/:docId/pdf        → binary PDF download
  POST   /api/notebook/docs/:docId/obsidian-sync → push to NISABA/ → { vault_path }
  DELETE /api/notebook/docs/:docId            → { ok }

Visualizations
  GET    /api/notebook/notebooks/:id/viz/entities    → EntityFreqData[]
  GET    /api/notebook/notebooks/:id/viz/temporal    → TemporalPoint[]
  GET    /api/notebook/notebooks/:id/viz/topics      → TopicNode[], TopicEdge[]
  GET    /api/notebook/notebooks/:id/viz/sentiment   → SentimentResult
```

---

